  m_text: '<b>Liar''s Dice</b>: a port of <b>VRC Liars Dice</b> by akalink (Garrett
    McPherson), MIT licence. Source: github.com/akalink/VRC-Liars-Dice. Port source:
    github.com/sidequestlegend/VRC-Liars-Dice (branch altspace). The script also
    holds the portkit runtime (MIT).

    Models, prefab and textures: VRC Liars
    Dice (MIT). Changed for Altspace: converted to URP, the dice shader remade, the
    dice atlas''s lettering redrawn, point-and-click buttons.

    Sounds: "dice_06.wav"
    by dermotte, freesound.org/s/220744, licensed CC BY 4.0 (creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0),
    made mono. "Dice Rolling on Table" by Flem0527 (freesound 629982) and "Audience
    Clapping.wav" by Zeraora (freesound 429422), CC0. Clicks, chime and jingles:
    Interface Sounds and Music Jingles by Kenney (kenney.nl), CC0.

    Fonts: Archivo
    Black, Copyright 2017 The Archivo Black Project Authors; Liberation Sans, Digitized
    data copyright (c) 2010 Google Corporation, Copyright (c) 2012 Red Hat, Inc.;
    both SIL Open Font License 1.1. Full licence texts: the kit''s Licenses folder.

    Not
    affiliated with VRChat. Click to close.'
